    "textUsed": "Pequeno Reino is an original Portuguese (PT-BR) peaceful hex tile city-builder for the web. The player is the cartografo-rei of a pocket Lusophone kingdom. Each turn they hold 3 cards, choose one, and place a hexagonal tile adjacent to the existing realm. Tiles are terrain, buildings, or people. Adjacency creates production chains: roca next to engenho yields flour; flour plus padaria yields bread"
